      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="NeedConfirmTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Need Confirm</source>
        <target state="translated">需要确认</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="NeedConfirmDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Try a color or gradient in the panel, then choose Confirm to update the bound value. Cancel, Escape, or dismissing the panel discards the draft. Clearing a color also requires confirmation.</source>
        <target state="translated">在面板中试选纯色或渐变，点击确定后才更新绑定值。取消、Escape 或关闭面板会放弃本次修改；清除颜色同样需要确认。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
